  ('SŌMA Yoga Studio', 'soma-yoga-studio', 'fitness-lifestyle', 'Serene yoga studio template with class schedules, teacher profiles, retreats and pricing plans.', 'Serene yoga studio template with class schedules, teacher profiles, retreats and pricing plans. Includes a responsive layout, editable sections and a premium visual style ready to launch.', '/templates/soma-yoga-studio.webp', '/templates/soma-yoga-studio-full.jpg', '', ARRAY['yoga', 'studio', 'classes', 'retreats']::text[], false, 'published', 24, '{"title": "SŌMA Yoga Studio Website Template", "og_image": "/templates/soma-yoga-studio-full.jpg", "description": "SŌMA Yoga Studio website template — serene yoga studio template with class schedules, teacher profiles, retreats and pricing plans. Preview the design and start with this template at BRANIFY."}'::jsonb),
